   "id": "02_quiz",
   "text": "Picture a made-up billing system. A customer pays thirty dollars a month. Ten days in, they click: switch to annual. Three hundred a year. What do you charge them, today? [pause] Three hundred? Two eighty? Or: it depends? [pause] <emphasis>It depends.</emphasis> On a rule nobody has written down. And an agent will build either answer, without asking.",
